
        {
            "id": "c74ae1c8-aa83-4e38-9df8-0d82debc0be3",
            "categoryId": "16f81b8b-b70e-4a8d-a7ca-e0edf7687d37",
            "name": "Student Visa Assistance",
            "description": "<p>We help students fulfill their dream of studying overseas by guiding them through the entire student visa process with proper documentation, interview preparation, and university communication.</p><p><br></p><h3>✅ Service Includes:</h3><p><br></p><h3>1. <strong>Country Selection &amp; Course Guidance</strong></h3><p>🎯 We help you choose the right country and course based on:</p><ul><li>Academic background</li><li>Budget and tuition fees</li><li>Career goals</li><li>Language preferences</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>2. <strong>University Admission Support</strong></h3><p>📚 Full support with:</p><ul><li>University shortlisting</li><li>Application processing</li><li>Statement of Purpose (SOP) and CV assistance</li><li>Recommendation letter guidance</li><li>Communication with universities</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>3. <strong>Visa Documentation Assistance</strong></h3><p>📝 We ensure your documents are complete and accurate:</p><ul><li>Offer letter collection</li><li>Financial documents (bank solvency, sponsorship, etc.)</li><li>Visa form filling</li><li>Passport &amp; photograph requirements</li><li>Language proficiency proof (IELTS/TOEFL)</li><li>Academic certificates</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>4. <strong>Mock Interview Preparation</strong></h3><p>🎤 We prepare students for embassy interviews through:</p><ul><li>Practice sessions</li><li>Question bank and answers</li><li>Body language tips</li><li>Confidence building</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>5. <strong>Visa Application Submission</strong></h3><p>📩 We assist with:</p><ul><li>Online or paper-based visa application</li><li>Visa fee payment</li><li>Appointment scheduling</li><li>Medical &amp; biometrics (if required)</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>6. <strong>Post-Visa Support</strong></h3><p>✈️ Once approved, we offer:</p><ul><li>Pre-departure briefing</li><li>Travel arrangement support</li><li>Accommodation guidance</li><li>Airport pickup service (Optional/Partnered)</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>🌍 Popular Destinations We Cover:</h3><ul><li>🇨🇦 Canada</li><li>🇬🇧 UK</li><li>🇦🇺 Australia</li><li>🇺🇸 USA</li><li>🇩🇪 Germany</li><li>🇭🇺 Hungary</li><li>🇲🇹 Malta</li><li> (And more based on demand)</li></ul><p><br></p>",
            "text": "Study abroad with confidence – Complete Student Visa support from start to finish.",
            "image": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dkutur2xo/image/upload/v1741786564/subcategory/mtkggniuslntekmekr5u.webp",
            "slug": "student-visa-assistance",
            "isActive": true,
