        {
            "id": "2bab73da-b025-40dc-be2b-9604e9dd425c",
            "categoryId": "e2f6c4a8-1d99-4a8a-bb63-d4c3800dd9bd",
            "name": " Google Ads",
            "description": "<h3>We help businesses reach their target audience at the right time through data-driven, ROI-focused advertising on Google Search, Display, Shopping, and YouTube networks.</h3><p><br></p><h3>✅ Service Includes:</h3><p><br></p><h3>1. <strong>Campaign Strategy &amp; Planning</strong></h3><ul><li>Business goal analysis</li><li>Competitor and industry research</li><li>Audience targeting &amp; location setup</li><li>Ad budget planning</li><li>Keyword selection based on high intent</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>2. <strong>Google Ads Campaign Types</strong></h3><p>We create and manage all types of campaigns:</p><ul><li>🔍 <strong>Search Ads</strong> – Appear on top of Google search results</li><li>🖼️ <strong>Display Ads</strong> – Banner ads across millions of websites</li><li>📺 <strong>YouTube Ads</strong> – Video ads before/during YouTube videos</li><li>🛒 <strong>Shopping Ads</strong> – For eCommerce product listings</li><li>📍 <strong>Local Ads</strong> – Bring customers to your physical location</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>3. <strong>Ad Creation &amp; Optimization</strong></h3><ul><li>Professional ad copywriting</li><li>Multiple ad variants (A/B Testing)</li><li>Ad extensions (callouts, site links, call buttons)</li><li>Attractive display ad banners</li><li>Conversion-focused landing page recommendations</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>4. <strong>Conversion Tracking &amp; Analytics Setup</strong></h3><ul><li>Google Analytics integration</li><li>Conversion tracking (form submissions, calls, purchases)</li><li>Call tracking &amp; event tracking</li><li>Tag Manager configuration</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>5. <strong>Ongoing Management &amp; Optimization</strong></h3><ul><li>Daily/weekly performance monitoring</li><li>Bid and budget adjustment</li><li>Negative keyword filtering</li><li>Quality Score improvement</li><li>CTR &amp; conversion rate optimization</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>6. <strong>Monthly Reporting</strong></h3><ul><li>Easy-to-read performance reports</li><li>Campaign insights (CTR, CPC, ROAS, etc.)</li><li>ROI breakdown and suggestions</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>🎯 Ideal For:</h3><ul><li>Service-based businesses</li><li>eCommerce stores</li><li>Local shops &amp; restaurants</li><li>Real estate &amp; education sectors</li><li>Any business looking to scale fast</li></ul><p><br></p>",
            "text": "Drive instant traffic, leads, and sales with expertly managed Google Ads campaigns.",
            "image": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dkutur2xo/image/upload/v1741786364/subcategory/f8vtshscwaok1pzqojoi.webp",
