        {
            "id": "20c0808d-d3d0-4bb3-a534-c687f6a6ee2c",
            "categoryId": "e2f6c4a8-1d99-4a8a-bb63-d4c3800dd9bd",
            "name": "YouTube Marketing",
            "description": "<h3>1. <strong>YouTube Channel Setup &amp; Optimization</strong></h3><ul><li>Professional channel creation</li><li>Banner, logo, and About section setup</li><li>Channel keywords and tags optimization</li><li>Playlist creation and branding</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>2. <strong>YouTube SEO</strong></h3><ul><li>Keyword research for video titles</li><li>Optimized video titles, descriptions &amp; tags</li><li>Custom thumbnail creation</li><li>Closed captions (Subtitles) &amp; SRT files</li><li>Hashtag and category optimization</li><li>End screens &amp; cards setup for engagement</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>3. <strong>Content Strategy &amp; Planning</strong></h3><ul><li>Competitor analysis</li><li>Audience analysis</li><li>Monthly content calendar</li><li>Trending topic research</li><li>Video series planning</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>4. <strong>Video Marketing &amp; Promotion</strong></h3><ul><li>Organic video promotion strategies</li><li>YouTube Ads (Skippable, Non-skippable, In-Feed Ads)</li><li>Social media sharing strategy</li><li>Embed in blog and website</li><li>Community engagement tactics</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>5. <strong>Analytics &amp; Reporting</strong></h3><ul><li>Monthly performance report</li><li>Watch time &amp; audience retention analysis</li><li>Click-through rate (CTR) tracking</li><li>Suggestions for improvement</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p>",
            "text": "Grow your brand on the world’s #2 search engine with powerful video marketing strategies.",
            "image": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dkutur2xo/image/upload/v1741786172/subcategory/nyqg1aw1aikcrpp2y8o9.webp",
