        {
            "id": "6b229c96-760b-4823-b3c4-74720477a825",
            "categoryId": "e2f6c4a8-1d99-4a8a-bb63-d4c3800dd9bd",
            "name": " Search Engine Optimization (SEO)",
            "description": "<p>Improve your website’s ranking on Google and increase organic traffic. We offer complete on-page and off-page SEO, keyword research, competitor analysis, and monthly performance reports.</p><p><br></p><h3>✅ <strong>Step-by-Step Process:</strong></h3><p><br></p><h3>1. <strong>Understanding the Business &amp; Target Audience</strong></h3><ul><li>Discuss the client’s business, niche, and target market</li><li>Identify key products/services and business goals</li><li>Understand customer pain points and search behavior</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>2. <strong>Competitor Keyword Analysis</strong></h3><ul><li>Identify top competitors in your niche</li><li>Use tools like SEMrush, Ahrefs, or Ubersuggest to extract ranking keywords</li><li>Analyze competitor content and keyword gaps</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>3. <strong>Seed Keyword Collection</strong></h3><ul><li>Create a list of core keywords (called seed keywords)</li><li>Include product/service names, location, industry terms</li><li>Use Google Auto Suggest, “People Also Ask” and “Related Searches”</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>4. <strong>Keyword Expansion &amp; Variations</strong></h3><ul><li>Generate long-tail keyword variations (e.g., “best SEO tools for small business”)</li><li>Find questions-based keywords using tools like AnswerThePublic</li><li>Use synonyms and LSI keywords to expand relevance</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>5. <strong>Keyword Metrics Analysis</strong></h3><p>Evaluate keywords based on:</p><ul><li>🔍 <strong>Search Volume</strong> (how many people are searching monthly)</li><li>⚔️ <strong>Keyword Difficulty (KD)</strong> – how hard it is to rank</li><li>💰 <strong>CPC (Cost Per Click)</strong> – for commercial value</li><li>📈 <strong>Trends</strong> – seasonal or growing trends</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>",
            "text": "Improve your website’s ranking on Google and increase organic traffic. We offer complete on-page and off-page SEO, keyword research, competitor analysis, and monthly performance reports.",
            "image": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dkutur2xo/image/upload/v1741778201/subcategory/nhltqq1dhagk5ttiber7.webp",
            "slug": "search-engine-optimization-seo",
            "isActive": true,
            "createdAt": "2025-03-12T11:16:41.639Z",
            "updatedAt": "2025-03-12T11:16:41.639Z"
        },
        {
            "id": "1a4cbaed-df02-4341-98cd-b2b17e08a0e7",
            "categoryId": "16f81b8b-b70e-4a8d-a7ca-e0edf7687d37",
            "name": "Air Ticket Booking & Travel Support",
            "description": "<h3>🛫 <strong>Air Ticket Booking Made Easy</strong></h3><p>Planning a trip abroad or inside the country? Whether you're a student going overseas, a tourist, or a business traveler — we've got your flights covered! Our Air Ticket Booking service ensures that you get the <strong>best deals</strong>, <strong>correct itinerary</strong>, and <strong>zero hassle</strong> throughout your journey.</p><p><br></p><h3>🧳 <strong>What We Offer:</strong></h3><ul><li>✅ International &amp; Domestic Flight Booking</li><li>✅ Round-trip / One-way / Multi-city Options</li><li>✅ Group Ticket Booking Support</li><li>✅ Flexible Date Options &amp; Lowest Fare Suggestions</li><li>✅ Travel Itinerary Planning</li><li>✅ Visa-friendly Date Management</li><li>✅ Urgent / Last-minute Ticket Arrangements</li><li>✅ Online Payment / bKash / Nagad / Bank Transfer</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>🧭 <strong>How It Works – Step by Step</strong></h3><p><br></p><ol><li><strong>Consultation &amp; Flight Requirements</strong></li><li> Tell us your destination, travel dates, and preferences.</li><li><strong>Flight Options &amp; Fare Comparison</strong></li><li> We’ll share multiple flight options to choose from.</li><li><strong>Confirmation &amp; Booking</strong></li><li> Once confirmed, we’ll proceed with ticket issuance.</li><li><strong>E-Ticket Delivery</strong></li><li> Your ticket will be sent to your WhatsApp and email.</li><li><strong>Optional Add-ons</strong></li><li> Travel insurance, hotel booking, airport pickup, etc.</li></ol><p><br></p><h3>🎯 <strong>Why Book With Us?</strong></h3><p><br></p><ul><li>Verified and trusted flight booking agents</li><li>24/7 customer support</li><li>Best deal guarantee</li><li>Visa coordination &amp; correct travel date handling</li><li>Local payment support (bKash, Nagad)</li><li>No hidden charges</li></ul><p><br></p>",
            "text": "Hassle-free international and domestic air ticket booking with flexible options, best rates, and expert travel assistance.",
            "image": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dkutur2xo/image/upload/v1741777619/subcategory/h5yvqvhp0h83d2lu0x5w.webp",
            "slug": "air-ticket-booking-travel-support",
            "isActive": true,
            "createdAt": "2025-03-12T11:07:00.221Z",
            "updatedAt": "2025-03-12T11:07:00.221Z"
