            "name": "Visa & Immigration Support",
            "description": "<h4>🔸 1. <strong>Introduction</strong></h4><blockquote>Traveling abroad made easy! Our visa experts will guide you through the entire visa process — from selecting the right visa type to preparing documents and submitting your application.</blockquote><blockquote><br></blockquote><h4>🔸 2. <strong>What We Offer (Service Types)</strong></h4><p>Showcase with icons or sections:</p><ul><li>🎓 Student Visa</li><li>✈️ Tourist/Visit Visa</li><li>👨‍🔧 Work Visa</li><li>👩‍❤️‍👨 Spouse/Family Visa</li><li>🌍 PR &amp; Immigration Services</li><li>❌ Visa Rejection Appeal Help</li><li><br></li></ul><h4>🔸 3. <strong>How We Work – Step-by-Step Process</strong></h4><p>Show this clearly on the page:</p><ol><li><strong>Free Consultation Booking</strong></li><li> – Initial discussion to understand your case and goals</li><li><strong>Eligibility Assessment</strong></li><li> – Country rules, required documents, and visa type selection</li><li><strong>Document Preparation</strong></li><li> – Checklist, SOP writing, CV formatting, and more</li><li><strong>Application Form Fill-up &amp; Review</strong></li><li> – We ensure zero mistakes</li><li><strong>Appointment Booking (if needed)</strong></li><li> – Embassy/VFS slots arranged</li><li><strong>Interview Preparation</strong></li><li> – Mock sessions and confidence building</li><li><strong>Submission &amp; Follow-up</strong></li><li> – We monitor updates and inform you</li><li><strong>Post-Visa Support</strong></li><li> – Travel tips, accommodation help, etc. (optional)</li></ol><p><br></p><h4>🔸 4. <strong>Why Choose Us?</strong></h4><ul><li>Up-to-date visa policy knowledge</li><li>1-on-1 guidance</li><li>High success rate</li><li>Transparent fees</li><li>Support till approval</li></ul><p><br></p>",
            "text": "US Visa From Bangladesh: Process, Interview & Consultants",
            "image": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dkutur2xo/image/upload/v1741774665/subcategory/vf2kkwuuel2x9yx8yktf.webp",
